  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>A theurge of 9th level or higher can use his innate magic to power wands. When he wields a wand that contains a spell on one of his spell lists, the theurge uses his own ability score (Intelligence for arcane spells, Wisdom for divine spells) to determine the wand’s save DC. At 14th level, a theurge uses his caster level when activating the power of a wand if it’s higher than the caster level of the wand.</p>\n<p><a href=\"http://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/theurge#toc13\">Source: Spheres of Power Wiki</a></p>",
      "instructions": ""
    },
